B.asu=new A.d0("ive-quant","IVE Quant","IVE Quant",B.Op,!1,!1,B.b_,null,B.aj1,B.H,!1,'FOUNDATION no Quant Lab (IV-QUANT-FOUNDATION-01): motor determin\xedstico server-side em supabase/functions/_shared/quant/. Sem tela, sem dados de mercado reais, sem corretora. Ver docs/quant/. lib/core/quant/strategy001_contracts.dart espelha a forma da state machine Strategy001/"Paulo Trend Fibonacci" -- a proveni\xeancia foi CORROBORADA em INSIGHTVALUES-ROBOT-BUILDER-MACRO-05: um worktree local real (n\xe3o o remoto GitHub que a MACRO-04 verificou) cont\xe9m insightvalues_quant/strategy001/ e /fibonacci/ com testes reais passando e um README id\xeantico, palavra por palavra, \xe0 cita\xe7\xe3o do doc de positioning; ver docs/commercial/STRATEGY001_SOURCE_FINDING.md. Nenhum algoritmo foi portado ou inventado. Adicionalmente (MACRO-04 \xa715-17): quant-runtime \xe9 a ponte Quant -> Action Intent -> AEF -- LAB-only, bloqueada de deploy, mock-only (internal.mock_quant_signal_acknowledgment) -- apenas o reconhecimento humano de um evento estrutural, nunca uma ordem ou sinal de negocia\xe7\xe3o. Sem wiring em rota/tela/provider.','FOUNDATION in the Quant Lab (IV-QUANT-FOUNDATION-01): server-side deterministic engine in supabase/functions/_shared/quant/. No screen, no real market data, no broker. See docs/quant/. lib/core/quant/strategy001_contracts.dart mirrors the shape of the Strategy001 / "Paulo Trend Fibonacci" state machine -- provenance was CORROBORATED in INSIGHTVALUES-ROBOT-BUILDER-MACRO-05: a real local worktree (not the GitHub remote MACRO-04 checked) contains insightvalues_quant/strategy001/ and /fibonacci/ with real passing tests and a README that is a word-for-word match for the positioning doc quote; see docs/commercial/STRATEGY001_SOURCE_FINDING.md. No algorithm was ported or invented. Additionally (MACRO-04 \xa715-17): quant-runtime is the Quant -> Action Intent -> AEF bridge -- LAB-only, deploy-blocked, mock-only (internal.mock_quant_signal_acknowledgment) -- only a human acknowledgment of a structural event, never a trade order or signal. No wiring into any route/screen/provider.',"QUANT_STATUS: FOUNDATION (library only) + CONTRACT_SCAFFOLD (Strategy001 mirror, provenance CORROBORATED em ROBOT-BUILDER-MACRO-05) + AEF_BRIDGE (quant-runtime, LAB-only). QUANT_COMMERCIAL_RECOMMENDATION: SEPARATE_PRODUCT. adminClickable=false: n\xe3o h\xe1 tela para abrir. Nenhuma execu\xe7\xe3o financeira existe: nenhum adaptador de corretora, nenhuma ordem; AEF v0 nega tiers de dinheiro real. MP-09 (MACRO-04, evolu\xeddo): quant-runtime pode existir enquanto CONSEQUENTIAL porque \xe9 independentemente fail-closed (bloqueado em resolve_deploy_selection.sh), n\xe3o porque nenhuma fun\xe7\xe3o exista. Ver tamb\xe9m m\xf3dulo separado strategy-builder (ROBOT-BUILDER-MACRO-05).",null)
